abstract: >-
  Interactive research atlas of recorded wars with Map, Globe, and Numbers
  views. Integrates geocoded battle and theater records from public datasets
  (HCED, Correlates of War, War Atlas, UCDP GED, MIDLOC) behind a transparent
  filtering and coverage model. A browser over ingested, geocoded records —
  not a complete history of all wars, and not a claim that any region “had the
  most war.”
